        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/768805ece53db17e58d42ed165918aa8.avif?t=1788876824\" alt=\"Welcome to the Ministry\" width=1168 height=126 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Dr Vincent Batten, who takes on his new role at the Ministry of Health of the Fourth Republic. Known as a care center for mentally unstable patients, you will find yourself curious, yet intimidated behind the walls of this facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In times when the republic is characterized by unrest and riots, it is all the more honourable to tackle such a task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your family must be proud!</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/5486ed47090fa94ae0afe369f753da34.poster.avif?t=1788876824\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1168 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/5486ed47090fa94ae0afe369f753da34.webm?t=1788876824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/5486ed47090fa94ae0afe369f753da34.mp4?t=1788876824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>A Doctor's Term</i> is a story-heavy walking sim featuring stunning environments,<br>thought-provoking narrative and an original soundtrack composed by Manolis Kalpenidis.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/97dcea5102137d799bc565c6329840a1.avif?t=1788876824\" alt=\"Lack of Opposition is Contribution\" width=1168 height=126 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A confidential adventure where freedom of choice may be bigger than anticipated.<br>Observe your patients, test new samples on them, follow your orders! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the job?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/1372c0e5c6ad5fb16e13aeff1869b6b1.avif?t=1788876824\" alt=\"\"width=1168 height=372 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/768805ece53db17e58d42ed165918aa8.avif?t=1788876824\" alt=\"Welcome to the Ministry\" width=1168 height=126 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Dr Vincent Batten, who takes on his new role at the Ministry of Health of the Fourth Republic. Known as a care center for mentally unstable patients, you will find yourself curious, yet intimidated behind the walls of this facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In times when the republic is characterized by unrest and riots, it is all the more honourable to tackle such a task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your family must be proud!</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/5486ed47090fa94ae0afe369f753da34.poster.avif?t=1788876824\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1168 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/5486ed47090fa94ae0afe369f753da34.webm?t=1788876824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/5486ed47090fa94ae0afe369f753da34.mp4?t=1788876824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>A Doctor's Term</i> is a story-heavy walking sim featuring stunning environments,<br>thought-provoking narrative and an original soundtrack composed by Manolis Kalpenidis.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/97dcea5102137d799bc565c6329840a1.avif?t=1788876824\" alt=\"Lack of Opposition is Contribution\" width=1168 height=126 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A confidential adventure where freedom of choice may be bigger than anticipated.<br>Observe your patients, test new samples on them, follow your orders! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the job?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/1372c0e5c6ad5fb16e13aeff1869b6b1.avif?t=1788876824\" alt=\"\"width=1168 height=372 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "A Doctor's Term is a first person, narrative experience with pivotal choices set in an ominous sci-fi government facility: The Ministry of Health — Enter a story of treating menacing medical cases where daily work often defies expectations...",
